===A3_S2_D3===
// talk to 2 beetles surrounded by pebbles and twigs
Narrator: You and Amelia come across what looks like a trio of… beetles?
Narrator: They’re moving around twigs and leaves of all sorts, almost like a construction site. 
Noelle: Should we…? #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Narrator: One of the beetles notice you.
Beetle: Kraken! Help! 
Narrator: Amelia facepalms. At the back of your mind, you wonder just how many other human-like behaviors she has.
Noelle: Hello… Do you need us to help you move the twigs? #portrait:NoelleBigSmile  
Beetle: No, no! 
Beetle: Need <i>better</i> twig!
Narrator: The twigs they have are all indeed snapped and thin. Probably not the best for building structures of any kind.
Noelle: Alright, we’ll get you some wood. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
